    description: "LLM assessment finding: AllocatedNum::clone ranks #2 by in-degree (139) in Nova due to #[derive(Clone)]. Similarly PrefixCheckpoint::unwrap ranks #1 in jolt, StatusRow::into ranks #5 in penumbra with 737 in-edges. Derive-generated methods (Clone, Default, Debug, Into) inflate centrality without architectural significance. Either filter them from ranking or apply a dampening factor similar to the existing common-method-name penalty."  # 5a94
