  message: "Deprioritized to P4. Derive-generated method dampening depends on detecting which methods come from derive macros, which requires either: (1) tree-sitter AST annotation tracking (derive attribute → generated methods), or (2) heuristic name matching (clone, into, default, debug, eq, hash, etc.). Option 2 is simpler and partially covered by the existing common-method-name penalty. Best addressed after the Rust trait resolution work (WI-ronoj) since both touch the same call resolution pipeline."  # c705
